  "grammar": [
   {
    "title": "Can / can't + base verb",
    "explanation_ar": "can لا تتغير مع الفاعل (I can, he can, they can) ويأتي بعدها الفعل في صيغته الأصلية بدون to وبدون s: She can swim (وليس She can swims).",
    "explanation_en": "\"Can\" is the same for all subjects. After it, use the base verb (no \"to\", no -s).",
    "examples": [
     "I can swim.",
     "He can cook.",
     "They can't juggle."
    ]
   },
   {
    "title": "Questions and short answers with can",
    "explanation_ar": "للسؤال نقدّم can على الفاعل: Can you swim? والجواب القصير: Yes, I can. / No, I can't.",
    "explanation_en": "To ask, put \"can\" first. Short answers: Yes, I can. / No, I can't.",
    "examples": [
     "Can you snowboard? - Yes, I can.",
     "Can he drive? - No, he can't."
    ]
   }
  ]
